{"title":"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 29","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of the sum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/9/cf9cd3208cf1e2e1cafd0d331a006ed98f245250.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S=\\sum_{k=0}^{49}(-1)^k\\binom{99}{2k}=\\binom{99}{0}-\\binom{99}{2}+\\binom{99}{4}-\\cdots -\\binom{99}{98}?$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"482\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/3/363a6a5a2cd73516476eaa010e2e325c5a93fab4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textrm{(A)}\\ -2^{50}\\qquad\\textrm{(B)}\\ -2^{49}\\qquad\\textrm{(C)}\\ 0\\qquad\\textrm{(D)}\\ 2^{49}\\qquad\\textrm{(E)}\\ 2^{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"433\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Binomial_Theorem\" title=\"Binomial Theorem\">Binomial Theorem</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/c/5cc0329e7592ede986cae37361c6734c0ec39e4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1+i)^{99}=\\sum_{n=0}^{99}\\binom{99}{j}i^n =$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"199\" height=\"53\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/f/66f1a2f013f2d8231adda0d8b943282746e62c60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{99}{0}i^0+\\binom{99}{1}i^1+\\binom{99}{2}i^2+\\binom{99}{3}i^3+\\binom{99}{4}i^4+\\cdots +\\binom{99}{98}i^{98}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"520\" height=\"53\" />. \n</p><p>Using the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/8/15839bf52ce0d08b363319978066941e261411f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i^1=i$\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/6/a56bfe567aec24da391224dc2f10e8cc4ef626dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i^2=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"63\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/d/bddc866835a16742412680d526524007359aa0ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i^3=-i$\" width=\"57\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/1/2a1f4b994f76715564166ae5baa38b849f3628ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i^4=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/0/ce03138c695e41ec753536fb6cb1c60696598fc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i^{n+4}=i^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"17\" />, the sum becomes: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/4/68447993b2f403a60777ab71ea0e587530fa0625.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1+i)^{99}=\\binom{99}{0}+\\binom{99}{1}i-\\binom{99}{2}-\\binom{99}{3}i+\\binom{99}{4}+\\cdots -\\binom{99}{98}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"531\" height=\"53\" />. \n</p><p>So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/1/b71c1c8014109a44a5a47e10d63d55cb6a26d71c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Re[(1+i)^{99}]=\\binom{99}{0}-\\binom{99}{2}+\\binom{99}{4}-\\cdots -\\binom{99}{98} = S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"454\" height=\"53\" />. \n</p><p>Using <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=De_Moivre%27s_Theorem\" title=\"De Moivre&#39;s Theorem\">De Moivre's Theorem</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/2/4b2c8aa9dabf6fe3e1d8ba2fb322369d14ceda6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1+i)^{99}=[\\sqrt{2}\\mathrm{cis}(45^\\circ)]^{99}=\\sqrt{2^{99}}\\cdot \\mathrm{cis}(99\\cdot45^\\circ)=2^{49}\\sqrt{2}\\cdot \\mathrm{cis}(135^\\circ) = -2^{49}+2^{49}i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"635\" height=\"24\" />. \n</p><p>And finally, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/0/fa0f097fb448aef70e95b23e537df65d2ecdf083.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S=Re[-2^{49}+2^{49}i] = -2^{49}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"217\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/c/13c3218ca790f4eac4048f34f68433655b19e1f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME\" title=\"1989 AHSME\">1989 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1989 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1989\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">Problem 28</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">Problem 30</a></b>\n</